{"seq":3,"slug":"rewind-model","title":"倒流数据模型：记录状态还是记录事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/foundations/rewind-model","wordCount":1682,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"倒流数据模型-记录状态还是记录事件\">倒流数据模型：记录状态还是记录事件</h1><p>Jonathan Blow 在 GDC 2010 讲《Braid》倒流实现时，花了很长篇幅解释他<strong>没有</strong>选事件重放。理由很朴素：让「重放输入让世界重新演算一遍」精确复现，太脆弱、太烦人、太贵。他最终选了直接记录每个物体的状态。这个选择不是品味问题，而是整个倒流系统最根本的架构分岔——记「世界现在长什么样」（状态），还是记「世界发生了什么」（事件）。这一篇把这条分岔讲透，它是后面记录、回放两章的公共地基，也是你和存档、确定性两个兄弟 hub 对话时的共同语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倒流数据模型回答的是「历史以什么形式被存下来」。全部设计都归结到一对概念，以及它们共享的抽象。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态记录（State Snapshot）</strong>：存「世界现在长什么样」，回退时直接写回，不重算、不依赖确定性、内存大。</li>\n<li><strong>事件记录（Event Sourcing）</strong>：存「世界发生了什么」，回退时从锚点重演，数据小、但强制逐比特确定性。</li>\n<li><strong>Rewindable 接口</strong>：<code>captureState / restoreState / interpolate</code> 三方法，把倒流能力收敛到对象自身，记录系统不关心具体类型。</li>\n<li><strong>离散时间轴</strong>：一串按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k = t_0 + k\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 排列的快照，是采样、插值、分层、分支的统一底座。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一对范式是整个 hub 的最底层分岔：后面记录章、回放章的每一个决定，都能追溯到这里选了哪一边。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两种范式\">两种范式</h2><p>时间轴上的每一帧，游戏世界都有一个完整状态。倒流要能回到过去，无非两条路：把每一帧的状态直接存下来，或者只存初始状态加上此后每一步的输入/事件，回退时重新算一遍。</p>\n<p><strong>状态记录（State Snapshot）</strong>：周期性地把物体的关键字段（位置、速度、血量、动画帧……）打成快照存进历史。倒流时直接把旧快照写回对象，世界瞬间还原。优点是回放不需要任何演算、不依赖确定性、任何一帧都能独立跳到；代价是每帧都要存全部状态，内存吃紧。</p>\n<p><strong>事件记录（Event Sourcing）</strong>：只存一个初始状态和之后每一步的「事件流」（玩家输入、随机数种子、外部触发）。倒流时从最近的锚点重新演算到目标帧。优点是数据极小（只有输入）；代价是回放必须逐帧重算，且<strong>要求世界演算完全确定</strong>——同样的输入必须永远得到同样的结果，否则还原出来的世界就和当初玩过的不一样。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[倒流数据模型] --&gt; B[状态记录]&#10;    A --&gt; C[事件记录]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[存每帧完整状态]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[回退=直接写回&lt;br/&gt;无需演算]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[内存大 不依赖确定性]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[存初始态+输入流]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[回退=从锚点重算&lt;br/&gt;需逐帧演算]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[内存小 强依赖确定性]&#10;    B2 --&gt; D[本 hub 主线]&#10;    C2 --&gt; E[见确定性/网络 hub]\">flowchart TD\n    A[倒流数据模型] --&gt; B[状态记录]\n    A --&gt; C[事件记录]\n    B --&gt; B1[存每帧完整状态]\n    B --&gt; B2[回退=直接写回&lt;br/&gt;无需演算]\n    B --&gt; B3[内存大 不依赖确定性]\n    C --&gt; C1[存初始态+输入流]\n    C --&gt; C2[回退=从锚点重算&lt;br/&gt;需逐帧演算]\n    C --&gt; C3[内存小 强依赖确定性]\n    B2 --&gt; D[本 hub 主线]\n    C2 --&gt; E[见确定性/网络 hub]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么本-hub-以状态记录为主线\">为什么本 hub 以状态记录为主线</h2><p>绝大多数「按键倒放」类玩法选状态记录，原因和 Blow 一样：它把「确定性」这个最难的约束整个绕开了。</p>\n<p>事件记录省内存，但它把复杂度转移到了确定性上。只要世界里有一处浮点运算在不同平台、不同编译器下结果不一致，或者有一个未纳入记录的随机源，重算出来的过去就会「漂移」，玩家会看到子弹落在不该落的地方。要驯服它，你得做定点数、统一随机数、锁死更新顺序——这套工程量本身就是一个 hub 的体量，正是 <a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/foundations/why-determinism\">游戏回放与确定性</a> 在讲的东西。</p>\n<p>而状态记录只要「存得下、写得回」，还原就一定精确，因为它压根不重算。对于内存中几秒到整关的短时倒流，这个交换划算。所以本 hub 后面两章默认走状态记录路线；事件记录只在 <a href=\"../practice/rewind-determinism\">确定性与浮点</a> 里作为「省内存的进阶选项」出现，并明确它的门槛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可倒流对象的抽象接口\">可倒流对象的抽象接口</h2><p>不管选哪种范式，工程上都需要一个统一契约，让「参与倒流」的对象自报家门。下面是状态记录路线下常见的接口形状（伪代码示意）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"interface Rewindable {&#10;    captureState(): StateBlob      // 把当前状态打包&#10;    restoreState(s: StateBlob)     // 从快照还原&#10;    interpolate(a: StateBlob, b: StateBlob, t): StateBlob  // 两帧间插值&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface Rewindable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    captureState(): StateBlob      // 把当前状态打包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    restoreState(s: StateBlob)     // 从快照还原</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    interpolate(a: StateBlob, b: StateBlob, t): StateBlob  // 两帧间插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>captureState</code> 决定「记什么」，是 <a href=\"../recording/state-snapshots\">状态快照</a> 的核心；<code>restoreState</code> 决定「怎么写回」，是回放的核心；<code>interpolate</code> 用于采样点之间的平滑，详见 <a href=\"../playback/reverse-playback\">倒放与插值</a>。把倒流能力收敛到这三个方法，好处是记录/回放系统只依赖接口、不关心具体对象，新增一种可倒流物体只需实现这三个函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间轴抽象\">时间轴抽象</h2><p>状态记录本质上是在维护一条离散时间轴：一串按时刻排列的快照。理解它有助于统一后面的所有操作。</p>\n<p>设采样间隔为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个快照对应的游戏时间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k = t_0 + k \\cdot \\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。倒流请求一个连续的目标时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，系统先找到相邻两个采样点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k \\le t &lt; t_{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8234em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再按插值系数</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = \\frac{t - t_k}{t_{k+1} - t_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1864em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用 <code>interpolate</code> 混合两帧。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时直接用快照 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，当采样足够密时插值误差可忽略。这条时间轴还能被切分、分层、分支——把单一全局时钟换成多条局部时钟就得到 <a href=\"../playback/selective-rewind\">选择性倒流</a>，把时间轴从某点岔开就得到 <a href=\"../playback/branching-timelines\">分支时间线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态-vs-事件对比\">状态 vs 事件对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>状态记录</th>\n<th>事件记录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>存什么</td>\n<td>每帧完整状态</td>\n<td>初始态 + 输入/事件流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退方式</td>\n<td>直接写回</td>\n<td>从锚点重算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>大，随时长线性增长</td>\n<td>小，只随事件数增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确定性要求</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>强制，逐比特一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机跳帧</td>\n<td>O(1) 直达</td>\n<td>需从锚点重放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本 hub 定位</td>\n<td>主线</td>\n<td>进阶省内存选项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表几乎能预测你项目的走向：短时、跨平台、想省心，走状态记录；超长历史、内存极紧、且团队愿意背确定性债，才考虑事件记录，且通常做成「事件为主、周期性状态锚点」的混合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>倒流的根本分岔是<strong>记录状态</strong>（存世界长什么样）还是<strong>记录事件</strong>（存世界发生了什么）。</li>\n<li>状态记录：回退即写回、不依赖确定性、内存大；事件记录：内存小、但强制逐比特确定性。</li>\n<li>本 hub 主线走状态记录，因为它绕开了确定性这个最难的约束；事件记录留作进阶选项。</li>\n<li>用 <code>captureState / restoreState / interpolate</code> 三方法接口收敛倒流能力，把系统与具体对象解耦。</li>\n<li>离散时间轴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k = t_0 + k\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是后续采样、插值、分层、分支的统一底座。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>记什么、怎么打包：<a href=\"../recording/state-snapshots\">状态快照</a></li>\n<li>采样间隔与插值系数落地：<a href=\"../recording/sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a></li>\n<li>跨库：事件记录的确定性代价，见 <a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/foundations/why-determinism\">游戏回放与确定性 · 为何需要确定性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"倒流数据模型：记录状态还是记录事件","id":"倒流数据模型-记录状态还是记录事件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两种范式","id":"两种范式"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么本 hub 以状态记录为主线","id":"为什么本-hub-以状态记录为主线"},{"level":2,"text":"可倒流对象的抽象接口","id":"可倒流对象的抽象接口"},{"level":2,"text":"时间轴抽象","id":"时间轴抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"状态 vs 事件对比","id":"状态-vs-事件对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"倒流机制谱系：四大原型与选型维度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/foundations/rewind-archetypes"},"next":{"title":"状态快照：捕获什么、怎么打包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/recording/state-snapshots"}}